            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-sm",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h3><strong>Air Optimized for Health™</strong></h3><p></p><p>At Blueair, we know that <em>health starts with air </em>— and we believe the best proof of that comes from trusted, independent voices. Our commitment to quality continues to earn recognition from respected third parties, most recently from Consumer Reports, which has just named Blueair the <strong>Best Air Purifier Brand of 2025. <br/></strong></p><p>This recognition reinforces our decades- long commitment to delivering cleaner, healthier air, and reflects the confidence that leading independent organizations put into our brand’s quality and performance.</p><p>The award honors our ongoing mission to design products that don’t just purify air — they optimize it for everyday wellbeing. From sleep to family health and comfort, Blueair transforms air care into <em>Air Health™</em>: intelligent, design forward innovation that supports better living in every breath.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
        "text_UJUwwY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-sm",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-sm",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-0",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-sm",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-sm",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Why Consumer Reports Chose Blueair</strong></h4><p></p><p>Consumer Reports, one of the world’s most trusted independent product reviewers, evaluated major air purifier brands based on performance, reliability, noise level, and owner usage. Blueair stood out across the board — earning top marks for consistent performance, innovation, and customer satisfaction.</p><p>This recognition reflects what we’ve built since our founding in Sweden in 1996: a brand defined by quiet power, thoughtful design, and measurable impact.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
        "text_CdTqbR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-sm",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-sm",
