            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-0",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-0",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-sm",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-sm",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Diving into what sets Blueair apart:</strong></h4><p></p><p>Below are just a few examples of how Blueair’s strategy is humanizing air care, helping us stand out from competition: </p><p><strong>Proven performance</strong> — Our HEPASilent™ technology captures 99.97% of airborne particles down to 0.1 microns, combining electrostatic and mechanical filtration for superior clean-air delivery.</p><p><strong>Quietly powerful</strong> — Blueair purifiers deliver best-in-class air cleaning while operating whisper-quiet — essential for sleep, productivity, and peace of mind.</p><p><strong>Design-forward wellness</strong> — Rooted in Swedish innovation, every purifier is crafted to complement modern living spaces beautifully and effortlessly.</p><p><strong>Trusted globally</strong> — Blueair has been leading the air purifier industry for nearly 30 years, with millions of satisfied customers worldwide.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "s3"
          }
        },
