            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-lg",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Our Vision: Health Begins Here</strong></h4><p></p><p>This recognition from Consumer Reports reinforces Blueair’s purpose — to create a future where health isn’t reactive, but instead, is built into everything around us. </p><p>We are proud to lead the Air Health category as the trusted name in home wellness, where technology, design, and connectivity intersect to create air optimized for every life stage, every lifestyle, and every home.</p><p>The truth is simple: <em>Health starts with air. </em>And Blueair is here to make that air better — beautifully, intelligently, and effortlessly.</p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        },
