            "richtext": "<h4><strong>Join the Movement Toward Air Health</strong></h4><p></p><p>Experience why Blueair was named the <strong>Best Air Purifier Brand of 2025 </strong>by Consumer Reports.  Explore our wide portfolio to discover what air care product is right for your space, whether it’s for your family, your sleep, or your peace of mind.</p>",
